# control.in -- template for DEBIAN/control of the aitools .deb (package launcher data)
#
# Rendered by build-package.sh deb (batch B10, plans/build-package/implementation-plan.md):
# lines starting with "#" are removed, @VERSION@ is replaced with --version
# (X.Y.Z, digits first, no "v" prefix). One package for Ubuntu 22.04 and 24.04,
# Architecture all, no version floors (BP-9). Prerequisites per BP-8: pwsh and
# node are installed by the user phase (aitools-setup), not here.
# Identifier: package name aitools (BP-17). Follows: BP-8, BP-9, BP-12, BP-17.
Package: aitools
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: nobul-tech <jose@nobul.tech>
Section: devel
Priority: optional
Depends: bash, perl, python3, git, curl, ca-certificates
Recommends: jq, sudo
Homepage: https://github.com/nobul-tech/aitools
Description: aitools harness (Claude Code / Cursor configuration and tools)
 Installs the aitools tree at a pinned release to /opt/aitools and the
 aitools-setup command. Run aitools-setup as each user (or as root in a
 container) to deploy the per-user configuration.
